.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH whoami 1  "whoami " 
.SH NAME
whoami \- Show the current login (username, registry, token, scopes)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwhoami\fR [\fB\-\-registry\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the current login (username, registry, token, scopes)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-registry\fR \fI<REGISTRY>\fR
Registry base URL (default: `FORGEHUB_REGISTRY` or config)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg whoami
